{
    "title": "Home Connect (America)",
    "description": "Control your smart kitchen and home appliances in a simple and convenient way with the Home Connect app. Download the free Home Connect app now!\r\n\r\nIntelligently connected to your household\r\n\r\nGet the most out of your smart home appliances from Bosch, Thermador, and Gaggenau by connecting them to the Home Connect app.\r\n\r\n- Control and monitor your kitchen and home appliances\r\n- Easier use of appliances \u2013 start & stop, select quick or silent options\r\n- Get helpful notifications, e.g., when your dishwasher has finished\r\n- Save time and energy by creating favorites\r\n- Enable exclusive in-app features and receive software updates for your appliances\r\n- Find recipes and endless cooking inspiration\r\n- Control and manage your smart appliances anytime, anywhere\r\n\r\nDid I switch off the oven? Instead of heading back home to check, simply take a look at the app. You will see and be able to control the status of your appliances straight away with immediate access to important functionalities, whether at home or on the go.\r\n\r\nBe aware of all that\u2019s important\r\n\r\nOh, the fridge door has been left open? When do I need to descale the coffee machine? How often should I clean the oven? Important notifications and reminders regarding maintenance and care will be sent to you automatically. And even if things don\u2019t go to plan:  use the support section to contact customer service or find helpful videos and articles.\r\n\r\nVoice-control your appliances via Amazon Alexa, or Google Home\r\n\r\nWhether it\u2019s making coffee, preheating the oven, or starting the washing machine: Use your voice with Amazon Alexa or Google Home will take care of the rest. What\u2019s more, you can use predefined or individual routines for recurring tasks to orchestrate your smart home, like having your coffee made at the same time each day.\r\n\r\nFinding the best program and other little helpers\r\n\r\nDishwasher, dryer, or oven \u2013 depending on the appliance and task at hand, you will be recommended the ideal program and settings, whether it\u2019s a pile of dirty dishes, a load of laundry, or the cheesecake recipe for your next family reunion. Based on your feedback, programs can even improve over time to better fit your needs. And with a Coffee Playlist you can conveniently fulfil your guests\u2019 coffee requests to match that cheesecake.\r\n\r\nNever run out on dishwasher tabs, fridge filters, or other consumables\r\n\r\nHome Connect gives you access to features that track your supply so you will never have to think about it again. Even better, connect to Amazon Alexa and its smart reordering service for your dishwasher tabs or fridge filters so they are reordered on demand before you need them.\r\n\r\nControl your home with your smartwatch\r\n\r\nMonitor and manage your appliances with your Wear OS by Google. \r\n\r\n\r\nIs my data safe?\r\n\r\nAbsolutely. All connections to Home Connect and our partners use TLS, a cryptographic protocol ensuring data transfer security. Additionally, each version of the Home Connect app is certified by T\u00dcV TRUST IT (Austria).\r\n\r\n\r\nDo you have any questions or feedback? Drop us a message at Info.us@home-connect.com, we\u2019re happy to hear from you.\r\n\r\n\r\nFind comprehensive information on Home Connect and all suitable appliances from Bosch, Thermador, and Gaggenau\r\n\r\nWebsite: https://www.home-connect.com/us/en/",
    "descriptionHTML": "Control your smart kitchen and home appliances in a simple and convenient way with the Home Connect app. Download the free Home Connect app now!<br><br>Intelligently connected to your household<br><br>Get the most out of your smart home appliances from Bosch, Thermador, and Gaggenau by connecting them to the Home Connect app.<br><br>- Control and monitor your kitchen and home appliances<br>- Easier use of appliances \u2013 start &amp; stop, select quick or silent options<br>- Get helpful notifications, e.g., when your dishwasher has finished<br>- Save time and energy by creating favorites<br>- Enable exclusive in-app features and receive software updates for your appliances<br>- Find recipes and endless cooking inspiration<br>- Control and manage your smart appliances anytime, anywhere<br><br>Did I switch off the oven? Instead of heading back home to check, simply take a look at the app. You will see and be able to control the status of your appliances straight away with immediate access to important functionalities, whether at home or on the go.<br><br>Be aware of all that\u2019s important<br><br>Oh, the fridge door has been left open? When do I need to descale the coffee machine? How often should I clean the oven? Important notifications and reminders regarding maintenance and care will be sent to you automatically. And even if things don\u2019t go to plan:  use the support section to contact customer service or find helpful videos and articles.<br><br>Voice-control your appliances via Amazon Alexa, or Google Home<br><br>Whether it\u2019s making coffee, preheating the oven, or starting the washing machine: Use your voice with Amazon Alexa or Google Home will take care of the rest. What\u2019s more, you can use predefined or individual routines for recurring tasks to orchestrate your smart home, like having your coffee made at the same time each day.<br><br>Finding the best program and other little helpers<br><br>Dishwasher, dryer, or oven \u2013 depending on the appliance and task at hand, you will be recommended the ideal program and settings, whether it\u2019s a pile of dirty dishes, a load of laundry, or the cheesecake recipe for your next family reunion. Based on your feedback, programs can even improve over time to better fit your needs. And with a Coffee Playlist you can conveniently fulfil your guests\u2019 coffee requests to match that cheesecake.<br><br>Never run out on dishwasher tabs, fridge filters, or other consumables<br><br>Home Connect gives you access to features that track your supply so you will never have to think about it again. Even better, connect to Amazon Alexa and its smart reordering service for your dishwasher tabs or fridge filters so they are reordered on demand before you need them.<br><br>Control your home with your smartwatch<br><br>Monitor and manage your appliances with your Wear OS by Google. <br><br><br>Is my data safe?<br><br>Absolutely. All connections to Home Connect and our partners use TLS, a cryptographic protocol ensuring data transfer security. Additionally, each version of the Home Connect app is certified by T\u00dcV TRUST IT (Austria).<br><br><br>Do you have any questions or feedback? Drop us a message at Info.us@home-connect.com, we\u2019re happy to hear from you.<br><br><br>Find comprehensive information on Home Connect and all suitable appliances from Bosch, Thermador, and Gaggenau<br><br>Website: https://www.home-connect.com/us/en/",
